  "hints": [
    "Maintain four boundary indices: top=0, bottom=len(m)-1, left=0, right=len(m[0])-1.",
    "Trace top row (left..right), top += 1; right col (top..bottom), right -= 1; then check `if top <= bottom:` before tracing bottom row; then `if left <= right:` before left col.",
    "Pseudocode:\n  while top <= bottom and left <= right:\n      emit top row; top += 1\n      emit right col; right -= 1\n      if top <= bottom: emit bottom row reversed; bottom -= 1\n      if left <= right: emit left col reversed; left += 1"
